      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Entities and Relationships\n1. User (Admin, Doctor, Patient)\nUserID (PK)\nUsername\nPassword\nRole (Admin/Doctor/Patient)\nName\nContactInfo\n\n\n\n3. Patient\nPatientID (PK, FK to User.UserID)\nDateOfBirth\nContactInfo\nMedicalRecordNumber\n\n\n5. Appointment\nAppointmentID (PK)\nPatientID (FK to Patient.PatientID)\nDoctorID (FK to Doctor.DoctorID)\nDepartmentID (FK to Department.DepartmentID)\nDate\nTime\nStatus\n\n\n7. Prescription\nPrescriptionID (PK)\nHistoryID (FK to PatientHistory.HistoryID)\nMedicines\nDosage\nInstructions\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Entities and Relationships\n1. User (Admin, Doctor, Patient)\nUserID (PK)\nUsername\nPassword\nRole (Admin/Doctor/Patient)\nName\nContactInfo\n\n\n\n3. Patient\nPatientID (PK, FK to User.UserID)\nDateOfBirth\nContactInfo\nMedicalRecordNumber\n\n\n5. Appointment\nAppointmentID (PK)\nPatientID (FK to Patient.PatientID)\nDoctorID (FK to Doctor.DoctorID)\nDepartmentID (FK to Department.DepartmentID)\nDate\nTime\nStatus\n\n\n7. Prescription\nPrescriptionID (PK)\nHistoryID (FK to PatientHistory.HistoryID)\nMedicines\nDosage\nInstructions\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
